  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "6.0.0 (breaking, major): the extraction/persistence pipeline moved to System.Text.Json. ParsedData.Data, IFileSinkFormat, and PostProcess now use System.Text.Json.Nodes.JsonObject (was Newtonsoft JObject); the Newtonsoft JObject IContentParser was removed — use IJsonContentParser.ParseToJsonAsync. Config/Job/cookie persistence is source-gen STJ (no TypeNameHandling); the persisted/wire format changed — clear distributed queues and stored config on upgrade. Rationale and migration: docs/adr/0008 and CHANGELOG.md.",
